cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the associated count dataset, please cite the Mendeley deposit and this repository."
title: "Pune CCTV Traffic Detect–Track–Count Pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Matange
    given-names: Ashwini
  - family-names: Abraham
    given-names: Jibi
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.17632/xnf2k6n288.1
    description: Heterogeneous Traffic Count Dataset, Pune (public CSV subset)
repository-code: https://github.com/YOUR_ORG/YOUR_REPO
abstract: >
  YOLOv8n + ByteTrack detect–track–count pipeline for direction-resolved
  heterogeneous traffic counts from Pune Traffic Police CCTV. The published
  dataset (2023) is the Mendeley count release (DOI 10.17632/xnf2k6n288.1;
  counts only). The train dataset (2022 raw CCTV video) is not published
  online due to privacy limitations. This repository ships code and docs only.
keywords:
  - traffic counts
  - CCTV
  - YOLOv8
  - ByteTrack
  - Pune
  - heterogeneous traffic
license: MIT
